     "level": "I",
     "q": "How does `groupby` work?",
     "a": "Split-apply-combine: `df.groupby(\"region\")[\"sales\"].sum()` splits rows by region, sums each group and combines the results. `.agg()` computes several aggregations at once, such as named aggregations.",
